guide forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale
title Stranglethorn Vale
faction Horde
levels 40-42
zone Stranglethorn Vale
next forever/horde/40-50/02-stranglethorn-vale
# Route from the Polestar route simulator's Horde consensus (Tauren export),
# visit 31 part 1/2, Stranglethorn Vale, levels 40.2-41.3. Checked by lint,
# not play-tested on Forever yet. Era + known Forever quests only.
#
# Flow: Shadowprey Village -> fly Ratchet -> boat to Booty Bay -> the
# Bloodsail cove, the Wild Shore and the Bloodsail ships -> Booty Bay ->
# Mistvale Valley (gorillas, Mokk) -> Zanzil's camps -> the Venture Co. mine
# -> Grom'gol (bind) -> Nesingwary -> Zul'Kunda -> hearth to Grom'gol ->
# jungle stalkers -> the naga shore and the Holy Spring -> Booty Bay (bind).
# The next guide finishes the jungle (ghosts, Zul'Mamwe) and goes on to the
# Swamp of Sorrows.
#
# Deviations from the simulator's order:
# - Skullsplitter Tusks (209): the tusks are gathered in the next guide at
#   Zul'Mamwe, with Speaking with Gan'zulah and Split Bone Necklace, instead
#   of in a separate Zul'Mamwe visit on the way north: every Skullsplitter
#   drops the tusks, and the necklaces alone need a long stay there.
# - Speaking with Nezzliok (585) is taken at the Bubbling Cauldron with
#   Speaking with Gan'zulah (586) here, not at level 44 (export visit 38):
#   its three trophy piles stand at Zul'Mamwe, Ziata'jai and Balia'mah, all
#   on the next guide's Zul'Mamwe loop, so merging saves a later trip from
#   Grom'gol.
# - Witch Doctor Unbagwa's part of Stranglethorn Fever (349) is taken before
#   the gorillas, so the fangs and the giblets come from the same kills.
# - Binds: the simulator's Booty Bay bind on arrival is dropped (replaced by
#   Grom'gol before any hearth). Grom'gol (for the hearth back from
#   Zul'Kunda) and Booty Bay (for the next guide) are kept.
#
# Turned in here from earlier guides: Sunken Treasure (669, from Shakes
# O'Breen in forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands) at Fleet Master Seahorn
# on the first Booty Bay stop; the export hands it in at level 44, on a
# separate Booty Bay trip that the next guides drop.
#
# Accepted here, finished later on the route: Stoley's Debt (2872) and
# Tran'rek (2864) in Tanaris; Cortello's Riddle (624) in the Swamp of
# Sorrows; Grim Message (2932) in the Hinterlands, around level 48.
#
# Left out: Sunken Treasure part 6 (670: Seahorn sends you back to Shakes
# O'Breen in Arathi, and the route never returns there); Goblin Sponsorship
# (1182: its chain 1178-1181 starts at Pozzik in Thousand Needles and runs
# through Gazlowe in Ratchet, none of it on the route, and Cozzle's
# footlocker sits in the Venture Co. camp at Lake Nazferiti, off this loop).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The way in

step Fly to Ratchet
  zone Desolace
  tip From Shadowprey Village fly to Ratchet.
  fly "Ratchet"

step Boat to Booty Bay
  zone The Barrens
  tip The boat to Booty Bay docks at the end of Ratchet's pier.
  goto 63.4,38.5 "Ratchet pier"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Booty Bay

step Booty Bay
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip The boat lands in Booty Bay's harbour. The quest givers stand on the boardwalks around the harbour and in the inn.
  accept 348                            -- Fin Fizracket
  accept 595                            -- First Mate Crazz
  accept 606                            -- "Sea Wolf" MacKinley
  accept 2872                           -- for Stoley in Tanaris
  accept 600                            -- Crank Fizzlebub
  accept 621
  accept 209                            -- Kebok
  accept 2864                           -- Krazek: for Tran'rek in Gadgetzan
  accept 617                            -- Privateer Bloads
  vendor nearest

step Bloodsail Correspondence
  tip Leave town by the tunnel; the note lies in the pirates' cove just north of Booty Bay.
  turnin 595
  accept 597

step Booty Bay
  turnin 597                            -- First Mate Crazz
  accept 599
  turnin 599                            -- Fleet Master Seahorn
  turnin 669
  accept 604
  accept 587                            -- Deeg
  accept 576                            -- Dizzy One-Eye

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Bloodsail Buccaneers

step The Wild Shore
  tip South of Booty Bay the Bloodsail swashbucklers camp on the Wild Shore; the charts and the orders lie in their tents. Any Bloodsail can carry snuff and Dizzy's eye, so keep killing until you have both.
  goto 29.3,82.8 "Wild Shore camp"
  kill 1563 quest 604.1
  collect 3920 quest 604.2 @28.1,82.1
  collect 3921 quest 604.3 @28.1,82.2
  collect 3910 quest 587.1
  collect 3897 quest 576.1

step Booty Bay
  turnin 604                            -- Fleet Master Seahorn
  accept 608
  turnin 587                            -- Deeg
  turnin 576                            -- Dizzy One-Eye

step The Bloodsail ships
  tip The three ships lie off the Wild Shore. Swim out and pull the crew to the rail one at a time; Firallon is level 48, so rest before you take him. A scroll, Cortello's Riddle, lies on the ships' decks: take it.
  goto 32.9,88.2 "Captain Stillwater"
  kill 2550 quest 608.1
  goto 29.3,88.3 "Captain Keelhaul"
  kill 2548 quest 608.2
  goto 30.6,90.6 "Fleet Master Firallon"
  kill 2546 quest 608.3
  collect 4056 "Cortello's Riddle"
  accept 624                            -- for a later stop in the Swamp of Sorrows

step Booty Bay
  turnin 608                            -- Fleet Master Seahorn

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North through the jungle

step Witch Doctor Unbagwa
  tip Take the road north out of Booty Bay; Unbagwa sits on a hill in Mistvale Valley, east of the road.
  accept 349

step Mistvale gorillas
  tip The gorillas roam the valley around Unbagwa. The elders drop the giblets; any of them can drop a fang.
  goto 33.0,64.2 "Mistvale Valley"
  collect 3919 quest 606.1
  collect 2799 quest 349.1

step Mokk the Savage
  tip Hand Unbagwa the fangs and stay by him: he calls three waves of gorillas, then Mokk. Fight them one at a time.
  turnin 349
  collect 2797 quest 348.1

step Zanzil's camps
  tip North-east of Mistvale, Zanzil's followers camp in the jungle; every one of them can carry the mixture.
  goto 39.7,58.1 "Zanzil's camp"
  goto 34.6,51.4 "Northern camp"
  collect 4016 quest 621.1

step Venture Co. mine
  tip Further north, the goblins of the Venture Co. dig at the mine east of the road; miners, foremen, surveyors and tinkerers all drop the crystals.
  goto 41.6,43.3 "Venture Co. mine"
  collect 3917 quest 600.1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Grom'gol and the north

step Grom'gol Base Camp
  tip Ride north-west to Grom'gol.
  sethome "Grom'gol Base Camp" npc 5814 -- Innkeeper Thulbek
  accept 573                            -- Far Seer Mok'thardin
  accept 584                            -- Nimboya
  accept 2932                           -- for later: the Hinterlands, around level 48
  accept 598                            -- Kin'weelay

step Nesingwary's Expedition
  tip Ride north up the road; the hunters camp on the hill above the river.
  accept 196                            -- Hemet Nesingwary

step Zul'Kunda
  tip West of the expedition, the Bloodscalp chiefs Gan'zulah and Nezzliok stand together in the ruins of Zul'Kunda. Clear their guards first, then pull them.
  goto 23.4,8.8 "Zul'Kunda"
  collect 3904 quest 584.1
  collect 3905 quest 584.2

step Hearth to Grom'gol
  hearth "Grom'gol Base Camp"
  turnin 584                            -- the Bubbling Cauldron, beside Nimboya
  accept 586
  accept 585

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- South to Booty Bay

step Jungle stalkers
  tip The stalker raptors hunt the jungle south of Grom'gol, out towards the west coast.
  goto 31.7,40.6 "Jungle stalkers"
  goto 27.0,47.8 "Western stalkers"
  kill 687 quest 196.1

step Naga shore and the Holy Spring
  tip Follow the coast south. The naga explorers wade along the shore and carry the reed bundles; the Holy Spring bubbles in the hills just east of them.
  goto 26.0,61.8 "Naga shore"
  kill 1907 quest 573.2
  collect 4029 quest 617.1
  collect 737 quest 573.1 @29.0,61.9

step Booty Bay
  tip Ride south to Booty Bay. Shaky Phillipe waits on the docks. The next guide starts here.
  sethome "Booty Bay" npc 6807          -- Innkeeper Skindle
  turnin 617                            -- Privateer Bloads
  turnin 606                            -- "Shaky" Phillipe
  accept 607
  turnin 607                            -- "Sea Wolf" MacKinley
  accept 609
  turnin 621                            -- Crank Fizzlebub
  turnin 600
  turnin 348                            -- Fin Fizracket
  vendor nearest
